                    insight_frozen:         `AI programme frozen: two verified incidents in one quarter tripped the board's freeze trigger. The efficiency machine is switched off and you're back to manual at roughly £24 CPA with a damaged brand — the most expensive way to learn that reckless autonomy and thin oversight don't pay.`,
                    insight_leader:         `Responsible AI leadership: you hit the board's CPA target AND recovered brand trust toward 71. You treated AI as a risk-weighted portfolio, gated the dangerous levers, and funded the brand — efficiency and trust moving together.`,
                    insight_paper:          `Paper efficiency: the CPA number satisfied the board, but brand trust collapsed beneath it. You bought the cut by shipping autonomous claims or opaque pricing — this is the efficiency that triggers round two of the viral post.`,
                    insight_bruised:        `You hit the CPA but bruised the brand. The regulator may be satisfied this quarter, yet with trust below where it started the efficient machine has less to convert next year.`,
                    insight_short:          `You missed the board's £19 CPA target. Protecting the brand mattered, but you left the safe, high-value AI levers — targeting and bid optimisation — under-used. The board wanted both, and the safe levers could have delivered it.`,
                    insight_trustfell:      `Brand trust ended below the 64 you inherited. For a brand whose entire equity is “honest beauty,” that is the most expensive line on the page — slow to build, fast to lose.`,
                    insight_incident:       `You triggered at least one verified brand-safety incident (£150k each). One more this quarter and the board freezes the whole AI programme. Oversight and a claim gate are cheaper than the incident they prevent.`,
                    insight_recovered:      `Brand trust recovered to or above the pre-incident 71 — the “honest beauty” equity is intact and the community has somewhere to come back to.`,
                    insight_complements:    `Efficiency and brand moved together: CPA at target, trust recovered and conversion lifting. That is the proof that AI tooling and brand investment are complements, not substitutes.`,

                    hint_frozen:            `The AI programme is frozen after two incidents. The lesson is upstream: oversight and claim gates are cheap relative to the incidents — and the trust — they prevent.`,
                    hint_paper:             `CPA is falling faster than trust can bear — you're buying a paper number with brand equity. Pull back autonomous content and opaque pricing; fund oversight and brand instead.`,
                    hint_incident:          `You've taken a verified incident. Tighten the claim gate and fairness audit before the second one freezes the whole programme.`,
